border-color\" data-source=\"uid\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-label\">UID</div></h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-data\"><code>S_END_DeadSmugglerSibling</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_END_DeadSmugglerSibling+type:localcharacter%2Cglobalcharacter%2Ccharactertemplate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_END_DeadSmugglerSibling+type:localcharacter%2Cglobalcharacter%2Ccharactertemplate\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"uuid\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-label\">UUID</div></h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-data\"><code>f5499fbc-61ed-4c7c-93e8-63bec48b75c5</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:f5499fbc-61ed-4c7c-93e8-63bec48b75c5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:f5499fbc-61ed-4c7c-93e8-63bec48b75c5\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stats\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-label\">Stats</div></h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-data\"><code>Dragonborn_Melee</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Dragonborn_Melee+type:statscharacter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Dragonborn_Melee+type:statscharacter\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div></section></aside>\n<b>Droralias Dryselis</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Dragonborn\" title=\"Dragonborn\">Dragonborn</a> smuggler whose body can be found in the <a href=\"/wiki/Morphic_Pool\" title=\"Morphic Pool\">Morphic Pool</a>. \n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>Droralias, like her sister <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Listelia_Dryselis\" title=\"Listelia Dryselis\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/77/Portrait_Listelia_Dryselis.png/25px-Portrait_Listelia_Dryselis.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/77/Portrait_Listelia_Dryselis.png/38px-Portrait_Listelia_Dryselis.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/77/Portrait_Listelia_Dryselis.png/50px-Portrait_Listelia_Dryselis.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Listelia Dryselis\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/77/Portrait_Listelia_Dryselis.png/25px-Portrait_Listelia_Dryselis.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/77/Portrait_Listelia_Dryselis.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Listelia_Dryselis\" title=\"Listelia Dryselis\">Listelia Dryselis</a>, was a smuggler for the <a href=\"/wiki/Knights_of_the_Shield\" title=\"Knights of the Shield\">Knights of the Shield</a> before perishing to the <a href=\"/wiki/Absolute\" title=\"Absolute\">Absolute</a>.\n</p><p>Her body is too damaged to use <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Speak_with_Dead\" title=\"Speak with Dead\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp/25px-Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp/38px-Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp/50px-Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Speak with Dead\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp/25px-Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8c/Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Speak_with_Dead\" title=\"Speak with Dead\">Speak with Dead</a> on. Returning <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Droralias%27_Teddy_Bear\" title=\"Droralias' Teddy Bear\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/MISC_Stuffed_Bear_Clean_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-MISC_Stuffed_Bear_Clean_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/MISC_Stuffed_Bear_Clean_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-MISC_Stuffed_Bear_Clean_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/MISC_Stuffed_Bear_Clean_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-MISC_Stuffed_Bear_Clean_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/MISC_Stuffed_Bear_Clean_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-MISC_Stuffed_Bear_Clean_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9a/MISC_Stuffed_Bear_Clean_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Droralias%27_Teddy_Bear\" title=\"Droralias' Teddy Bear\">Droralias' Teddy Bear</a> to the inventory of Droralias' corpse prompts special party banter. Using Speak With Dead on her sister Listelia's corpse beforehand is likely required to trigger this banter - in order to learn about the significance of the teddy bear first.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Loot\">Loot</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Healing\" title=\"Potion of Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/POT_Potion_of_Healing_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Healing\" title=\"Potion of Healing\">Potion of Healing</a></span></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_Items\">Related Items</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Droralias%27_Teddy_Bear\" title=\"Droralias' Teddy Bear\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/MISC_Stuffed_Bear_Clean_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-MISC_Stuffed_Bear_Clean_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/MISC_Stuffed_Bear_Clean_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-MISC_Stuffed_Bear_Clean_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/MISC_Stuffed_Bear_Clean_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-MISC_Stuffed_Bear_Clean_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/